flowchart TB
  accTitle: The public boundary of DorkOS Cloud
  accDescr: Optional local Cloud clients use HTTPS. An older link client and the versioned public client coexist and resolve different origins. The versioned client resolves authenticated instance identity before minting scoped inference credentials under the same current link. A Runs on choice selects credits; the minted token's served list gates each runtime's request format, and the environment variable can only disable credits. The managed remote consumer is built and off until its switch is set. The public contract is a schema package, not deployment proof. Remote-access paths are a separate view.

  subgraph app["Open-source app · your computer"]
    local["<b>Local DorkOS server</b><br/><span class='d'>Runs without a Cloud link</span>"]
    legacy["<b>Link and managed-services client</b><br/><span class='d'>The older routes</span>"]
    versioned["<b>Versioned client</b><br/><span class='d'>The public v1 contract · one captured credential</span>"]
    credits["<b>Runs on: DorkOS credits</b><br/><span class='d'>A person's choice, per runtime<br/>Format gated by the token's served list</span>"]
    remote["<b>Managed remote consumer</b><br/><span class='d'>Command stream · leases, acks, journal<br/>Built · off until switched on</span>"]
    local --> legacy
    local --> versioned
    local --> credits
    local --> remote
  end

  control["<b>Cloud service origin</b><br/><span class='d'>One origin for link routes, one for v1</span>"]
  inference["<b>Inference endpoint</b><br/><span class='d'>URL and scoped token minted per session</span>"]
  contract["<b>Public contract package</b><br/><span class='d'>Schemas · routes · fixtures · fetch client</span>"]
  spaceadmin["<b>Space server administration API</b><br/><span class='d'>Scoped keys · limits · usage · implemented</span>"]

  legacy -->|"link, heartbeat<br/><span class='d'>managed actions, event pull and ack</span>"| control
  versioned -->|"v1 with bearer<br/><span class='d'>identity first, then mint</span>"| control
  remote -->|"command stream<br/><span class='d'>when switched on</span>"| control
  credits -->|"inference over HTTPS<br/><span class='d'>when chosen and available</span>"| inference
  contract -.->|"wire schema, not deployment proof"| control
  control -.->|"space management<br/><span class='d'>contract only · no database access</span>"| spaceadmin

  classDef cloud fill:#fff5e4,stroke:#a87720,color:#49320c
  class control,inference cloud
